WEBVTT

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.427 line:82%
Chapter 5. Run a live test in class.

00:00:04.835 --> 00:00:09.286 line:82%
Turn on the projector, then press the blue "Start a test" button.

00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:15.165 line:82%
Choose the lesson. Test 1 is before you teach. Test 2 is after you teach.

00:00:15.631 --> 00:00:18.146 line:82%
Press "Open the waiting room".

00:00:18.611 --> 00:00:25.926 line:82%
The waiting room shows the QR code and the address. Students join, and their names and animals appear.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:32.246 line:82%
If a student taps the wrong name, press the small cross next to the name to free it.

00:00:32.714 --> 00:00:36.606 line:82%
When everyone is in, press "Start the first question".

00:00:37.072 --> 00:00:42.826 line:82%
The question is on the projector and on the phones. You see how many students have answered.

00:00:45.641 --> 00:00:52.205 line:82%
Need more time? Press "+15 s". When enough students have answered, press "Close answers".

00:00:52.670 --> 00:01:00.273 line:82%
Press "Reveal answer". You see how the class answered, and the most common wrong answers. This is what you will teach.

00:01:00.733 --> 00:01:05.692 line:82%
Press "Leaderboard" to show the top students, with their points and streaks.

00:01:06.154 --> 00:01:08.653 line:82%
Then press "Next question".

00:01:10.553 --> 00:01:21.092 line:82%
You can also use the keyboard, or a presenter clicker. Space, or the right arrow, goes to the next step. R shows the answer, and L shows the leaderboard.

00:01:21.554 --> 00:01:26.553 line:82%
Here we jump to the last question. At the end, press "Finish test".

00:01:27.004 --> 00:01:33.333 line:82%
The podium shows third place, then second place, and then the winner, with music and confetti!

00:01:36.794 --> 00:01:42.412 line:82%
Press "Show full ranking" to see everyone, or "Replay podium" to play it again.

00:01:42.872 --> 00:01:52.052 line:82%
"Save clip" makes a 15-second video of the podium, for WhatsApp status or TikTok. It shows first names and animals only.

00:01:52.521 --> 00:01:59.080 line:82%
On their phones, students tap "Share my card": a picture of their result, to save or send.

00:01:59.542 --> 00:02:07.061 line:82%
Press "Done: after class". The results are saved, and one page shows everything to do next, in any order.

00:02:07.528 --> 00:02:12.440 line:82%
The class average, the skills to teach again, and the students who need help.

00:02:12.906 --> 00:02:17.181 line:82%
The students who did not take part, so you can mark them absent.

00:02:17.646 --> 00:02:21.860 line:82%
Bonus points, words to send home, and a worksheet to print.

00:02:22.321 --> 00:02:27.800 line:82%
And the next step: Teach. It opens the lesson plan. Chapter 6 shows it.

00:02:28.254 --> 00:02:33.761 line:82%
Back on Home, the blue box already shows the next step: Teach, then Test 2.
